{
  "project": "袴田事件：58年",
  "voice_id": "voice-00",
  "language": "zh-CN",
  "completed": 30,
  "planned": 30,
  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "text": "2024年9月26日清晨，静冈地院外，人群等待宣判。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S01.mp3",
      "bytes": 48710,
      "sha256": "72790c5b3775701f0bd9327c3b03af8f5455f57a6937dcf2e4bdc6a40e9ced0f"
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "text": "他等了五十八年，才等来一句无罪。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S02.mp3",
      "bytes": 31782,
      "sha256": "e1262867b28977f8cf8f463477f12c835ba508da18f11b5186536c938ffa675f"
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "text": "1966年6月30日深夜，静冈一栋住宅起火。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S03.mp3",
      "bytes": 39724,
      "sha256": "7f9cc8a39bc602116b91a2fd475650ee20697ab57c52794344d971a3b16d2b9a"
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "text": "消防车赶到，警灯穿过浓烟，火势吞没街区的夜色。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S04.mp3",
      "bytes": 46202,
      "sha256": "71e8899a54401454bb6217dfd2b3c2c1b16783f99986493a8451e16912daa327"
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "text": "黎明后，警方确认一家四口遇害，现场展开勘查。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S05.mp3",
      "bytes": 38261,
      "sha256": "de05eeef33f2e61e5c30372158303491901f9bebdd81042671be2ee54fdf2167"
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "text": "屋内现金失踪，警方据此以强盗杀人案立案。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S06.mp3",
      "bytes": 45575,
      "sha256": "738470f8080615a44feea7cd7fba3373d11e34669e641a789e9e5a4e8b5ab1ce"
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "text": "八月，警方逮捕味噌厂员工袴田岩，时年三十岁。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S07.mp3",
      "bytes": 47874,
      "sha256": "d0e5d0741b7b62381289d8388eec912ed3ae5f0adff499bbfb6aefc8e1bdbf05"
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "text": "前拳击手袴田没有反抗，平静地跟随警方离开。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S08.mp3",
      "bytes": 33245,
      "sha256": "4a12a0ebbe1edffebd3fd6c33aaa93701ce027da17ffed63836c654edd1c748b"
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "text": "连续数周，他每天接受十多个小时审讯，日夜交替。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S09.mp3",
      "bytes": 41395,
      "sha256": "b172e6049fc2d59807450cc14eff59253939aea49f64c848f334419181a8cfe7"
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "text": "长讯问后，他签下口供；庭审上却否认杀人。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S10.mp3",
      "bytes": 37007,
      "sha256": "ec5420b7319b7c608974aac00f176df25ec5c313ebf8e7a5192226aed36c9327"
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "text": "一年多后，工厂一只味噌桶底发现了包裹的衣物。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S11.mp3",
      "bytes": 38261,
      "sha256": "204bbd6649824d4687a7f8ee1924a728f7e7f722f666f2dfb68d98b2ee0b3e17"
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "text": "警方把五件旧衣物列为关键证据，送入证物室检验。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S12.mp3",
      "bytes": 44530,
      "sha256": "876cfc294c7d0bdcfbb1b156b25675bbb308b9b368c2005a711b840a2046d5ef"
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "text": "1968年，袴田当庭翻供，说自己没有杀人。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S13.mp3",
      "bytes": 39097,
      "sha256": "3e5280eee699902d5a15d7fa980dd70c28c0d6d5804da5e2e8389f0be37de14b"
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "text": "但同年，他被判处死刑；1980年，死刑判决最终确定。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S14.mp3",
      "bytes": 53098,
      "sha256": "30be08207e48682a008c1efcd88a7e750492fdd147cd31b57817774ca8afda43"
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "text": "此后，他被关在东京拘置所，漫长岁月从高墙内开始。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S15.mp3",
      "bytes": 52053,
      "sha256": "42f2a6240bd97e618f2c2cf04e4bc7b71ca96289ced5776217e02e5065bb0954"
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "text": "死刑犯只在执行当天早晨才会被告知，等待因此变成日常。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S16.mp3",
      "bytes": 47874,
      "sha256": "174b59f120340c9a76f9df6c7f6a0502dcbdde9242f792163e12a90b2a051605"
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "text": "日历从六十年代翻过数十年，他从壮年等到白发。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S17.mp3",
      "bytes": 43903,
      "sha256": "431978da20697f3b47057f0f8dfa2cffbefc22b898d3a7e2deb145944a451f5f"
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "text": "每个清晨，走廊脚步停在门外，他都屏息等待那个消息。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S18.mp3",
      "bytes": 37216,
      "sha256": "765d4a640076f233c0bd6ec033ccc91557eb3bf0cb60333236be3231c410e7fb"
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "text": "姐姐秀子不相信弟弟有罪，她一封封写信、整理材料。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S19.mp3",
      "bytes": 42231,
      "sha256": "ce78d535a45760d567dfe6894d75b7c16eafd262db5d0aecaf99349125f6d212"
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "text": "她走上街头发传单，面对匆忙路人一次次鞠躬。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S20.mp3",
      "bytes": 36589,
      "sha256": "cffd01df2963901aa22bfa4bb081605524560adc702820ff90b2d654ebf09551"
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "text": "1981年，第一次再审申请提出；此后，多次申请都被驳回。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S21.mp3",
      "bytes": 52680,
      "sha256": "af763191d5f6bb2eb1f59dbe21586fadc92820cad64d75eeb2d9f3ce2d0637d0"
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "text": "2014年3月，DNA新证据促成再审，袴田获释。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S22.mp3",
      "bytes": 44530,
      "sha256": "c04b2e3edaa0d4d123fee69081fd57345f83dba391d3ba8201d610675d60fcd4"
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "text": "检察机关提出抗告，再审之路一度再次被关上。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S23.mp3",
      "bytes": 40769,
      "sha256": "980179b6e00cfb6a0f87f587f054ec3c8489addc3cd5f5634bb8c91bb4838b4a"
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "text": "律师团把白布浸入味噌，观察颜色随时间发生变化。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S24.mp3",
      "bytes": 47874,
      "sha256": "1f8f257342b99263fa5fef0060a15dfb51697a9c3de7e93ee28e8dbc4c23410a"
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "text": "味噌实验质疑关键证据，2023年3月，高院决定重审。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S25.mp3",
      "bytes": 46202,
      "sha256": "2fd8694746b731bf5edb63fbbf739c71ada65a41e0e09060657c80cc89ace00f"
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "text": "2024年9月26日，静冈地方法院再次审理这起案件。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S26.mp3",
      "bytes": 41395,
      "sha256": "fd2c1cabe16bd0b3a4c2f72d21feca54de7437ee3b30d9cd8af221c15ac9c183"
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "text": "法院宣告无罪；姐姐流泪，袴田静静坐着。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S27.mp3",
      "bytes": 44112,
      "sha256": "10b5e29d25ddb2ee35f83dd91367fb5ecc329d541c0aee580228a391bcc84758"
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "text": "衣物、衣物碎片与口供，法院认定遭侦查机关捏造。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S28.mp3",
      "bytes": 45575,
      "sha256": "1171236ab4ae916c99228ccb59516dd01895264e0e846b2f90d6e99476b5399c"
    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
      "text": "姐姐说，终于画上句号；迟来的黄昏暖光落在两人身上。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S29.mp3",
      "bytes": 47665,
      "sha256": "7a04f38ecda322c00e14f2b083a2c492f3df24cf168273014347a34e6671e325"
    },
    {
      "id": "S30",
      "text": "一个国家，该怎样对待被它冤枉了五十八年的人？",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S30.mp3",
      "bytes": 39724,
      "sha256": "b9b28d40d60f1d919239e41452733ccc0651911fdc50a9c45e47cf49011562f0"
    }
  ]
}
